onitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}, and the target takes a –20-foot status penalty to all Speeds until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.5roCV7EbPx1G5xOd]{Effect: Mangling Rend}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9PueFwTWh8gUq2Rd.ZxIVdGLdVzJ1RVHi"},{"_id":"AuM50DWRYYFugkl6","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Terrifying Display","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The megaprimatus beats its chest in a terrifying display. Creatures within @Template[emanation|distance:50]{50 feet} must attempt a @Check[will|dc:27|name:Frightening Display] save.</p>\n<p>While a creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened} by this ability, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to the megaprimatus and to gorillas.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> No effect and temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} until the end of its next turn.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!9PueFwTWh8gUq2Rd.AuM50DWRYYFugkl6"}],"name":"Megaprimatus","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":-4},"str":{"mod":7},"wis":{"mod":1}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":26},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":150,"temp":0,"value":150},"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":30}],"value":30}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":8},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>The megaprimatus is among the mightiest of apes, quick to confront any perceived intrusions into its domain. With a height of 40 feet, it towers over even most giants, and is used to being the top-tier predator in the region.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>While many apes exhibit peaceful or reclusive behavior, gorillas can be territorial, and the megaprimatus is especially aggressive and dangerous.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":30,"type":"scent"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":19},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":16},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":13}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":14},"athletics":{"base":19}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"grg"},"value":["animal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.pyTr1VOPrPYH8UNg"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!9PueFwTWh8gUq2Rd","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-monster-core/megaprimatus.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":